# ENS Layer2 Resolution Project Structure

This project implements ENS domain resolution on Layer 2 (Optimism) using Unruggable Gateways.

## Core Contracts

- [contracts/StorageContract.sol](mdc:contracts/StorageContract.sol): 存储域名解析数据的合约
- [contracts/ENSManager.sol](mdc:contracts/ENSManager.sol): 管理域名注册和解析的合约

## Deployment Scripts

- [script/DeployL2Contracts.s.sol](mdc:script/DeployL2Contracts.s.sol): L2 合约部署脚本
- [script/DeployL1Contracts.s.sol](mdc:script/DeployL1Contracts.s.sol): L1 合约部署脚本
- [script/SetupResolver.s.sol](mdc:script/SetupResolver.s.sol): 设置 ENS Resolver 的脚本

## Tests

- [test/StorageContract.t.sol](mdc:test/StorageContract.t.sol): StorageContract 单元测试
- [test/ENSManager.t.sol](mdc:test/ENSManager.t.sol): ENSManager 单元测试
- [test-resolution.ts](mdc:test-resolution.ts): 端到端测试脚本

## Frontend

前端代码位于 `frontend/` 目录，基于 ENS App v3 构建，但进行了精简和定制。

- [frontend/src/hooks/useL2Resolver.ts](mdc:frontend/src/hooks/useL2Resolver.ts): L2 解析钩子
- [frontend/src/components/RegisterSubdomain.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/RegisterSubdomain.tsx): 注册子域名组件

## Deployment Process

1. 部署 L2 合约: `forge script script/DeployL2Contracts.s.sol --rpc-url $OPTIMISM_RPC_URL --broadcast`
2. 部署 L1 合约: `forge script script/DeployL1Contracts.s.sol --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_RPC_URL --broadcast`
3. 设置解析器: `forge script script/SetupResolver.s.sol --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_RPC_URL --broadcast`
